      "en": "PROCESSES FOR THE ELECTROLYTIC PRODUCTION, RECOVERY OR REFINING OF METALS; APPARATUS THEREFOR(anodic or cathodic protection <b>C23F13/00</b>; single-crystal growth <b>C30B</b>)",
